cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this project, please cite it as below."
title: "OpsForge Nexus"
abstract: >-
  Reliability analytics and release decisioning for a microservice fleet:
  canary rollouts gated by a sequential probability ratio test, SLO
  error-budget burn-rate alerting, a three-layer anomaly suite requiring
  cross-layer consensus, dependency-aware cascade detection, chaos drills that
  measure detection and rollback latency, and priced incident impact.
type: software
